# Runtime noise (server/proxy/worker stdout -- not analysis data;
# the actual measured results are the tracked CSV/JSON files in results/).
# **/*.log (not just results/*.log) so a nested run directory's manifest/noise
# logs are caught too, not just top-level ones -- results/*.log alone missed
# results/<run>/manifest.log, which is the same kind of runtime noise.
results/**/*.log
nohup.out
*.pid

# Local env files
.env

# Claude Code session/config data -- not part of the research project.
# (Lives at the parent directory level today, not inside this repo -- this
# entry is a guard in case that ever changes, e.g. git init one level up.)
.claude/

# Not pushed yet: draft vendor disclosure email, kept local until it's actually
