# the tracked CSV/JSON in results/, not re-running the GPU experiments), and
# 440MB is not worth the Git LFS quota until that's actually needed. Configs
# (adapter_config.json) are still tracked -- only the weight files are excluded.
adapters/**/adapter_model.safetensors
docs/PROJECT.md
